              "transformation_target_id": "asset:image_1"
            }
          ],
          "format": "teacherhelper-normalized",
          "sections": [
            {
              "key": "condition",
              "html": "<p><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"b558b62a-346c-4553-987d-f417cd5132b7\" data-asset-key=\"image_1\" data-transformation-target-id=\"asset:image_1\" src=\"/assets/b558b62a-346c-4553-987d-f417cd5132b7\"/>У тре­уголь­ни­ка со сто­ро­на­ми 9 и 6 про­ве­де­ны вы­со­ты к этим сто­ро­нам. Вы­со­та, про­ве­ден­ная к пер­вой сто­ро­не, равна 4. Чему равна вы­со­та, про­ве­ден­ная ко вто­рой сто­ро­не?</p>",
              "title": "Условие",
              "asset_keys": [
                "image_1"
              ],
              "section_id": "condition:1",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:condition:1"
            },
            {
              "key": "answer",
              "html": "<p><span data-effect=\"spaced\">6</span></p>",
              "title": "Ответ",
              "asset_keys": [],
              "section_id": "answer:1",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:answer:1"
            },
            {
              "key": "source",
              "html": "<p>Источник: <a href=\"https://math-ege.sdamgia.ru/test?id=54194441\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">ЕГЭ по математике 01.06.2023. Основная волна. Сибирь/Урал</a></p>",
              "title": "Источник",
              "asset_keys": [],
              "section_id": "source:1",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:source:1"
            },
            {
              "key": "solution",
              "html": "<p>Вы­ра­зим пло­щадь тре­уголь­ни­ка двумя спо­со­ба­ми:  <span data-inline-latex=\"S_{ABC}=\\frac{1}{2}CH\\cdot AB=\\frac{1}{2}AK\\cdot CB\"></span>.</p><p>Сле­до­ва­тель­но,</p><center><p> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\frac{1}{2}CH\\cdot AB=\\frac{1}{2}AK\\cdot CB\\iff AK=\\frac{CH\\cdot AB}{CB}\\iff AK=\\frac{4\\cdot 9}{6}\\iff AK=6\"></span>. </p></center>",
              "title": "Решение",
              "asset_keys": [],
              "section_id": "solution:1",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:solution:1"
            }
          ],
          "schema_version": 3,
          "problem_reference_ids": {
            "prototype_problem_id": null,
            "group_parent_problem_id": null,
            "adjacent_group_parent_problem_id": null
